      "name": "陈金凤",
      "old_description": "本批《资治通鉴》与二十四史所见人物：陈金凤，原淑妃、皇后获立者。",
      "claim_id": "ef115348-54f8-56aa-b764-46b995ad2f79",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；二月条下）·zztj-v279-y0935-p007·原文件第91行",
      "source_sha256": "fadb91dac524ff4eb395a911f03221a27b18e2d4aeb53e58a9d3ae75da836d66",
      "quotation": "闽主立淑妃陈氏为皇后。",
      "quotation_verified": true
    },
    {
      "person_id": "e56fbbf9-5a13-5b0e-ab07-aaddfd770eb5",
      "name": "归守明",
      "old_description": "本批《资治通鉴》与二十四史所见人物：归守明，闽主幸臣、被记私通者。",
      "claim_id": "c8d46c90-f421-5879-9553-17ca8f5ee93d",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/53d64599/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0935/part-03/sources/library/tongjian-279-935-jinzhou-min/source.txt",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；十月条下及追叙、史评）·zztj-v279-y0935-p029·原文件第113行",
      "source_sha256": "b8f4f60dfa6c6f9f2253585b0e43422f8cfcce1497e207954d4891eb5b51bc0b",
      "quotation": "初，闽主有幸臣曰归守明，出入卧内。闽主晚年得风疾，陈后与守明及百工院使李可殷私通，国人皆恶之，莫敢言。",
      "quotation_verified": true
    },
    {
